AUDIO: 'gets mirrored, re-uploaded, forked into a dozen copies. There\'s already a shelf of these Claude-flavored quents, uncensored forks, and 35B siblings. Most shipping with cherry-picked benchmarks'

[06:58] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'or none at all. Half those downloads are tools auto pulling it and scripts retesting it. A download counts a click, not a keeper. It tells you a model was fashionable for a week, and nothing whatsoever about'

[07:11] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'whether it\'s any good. And yet it keeps getting waved around like it settles the argument. So, the next time a model card lights up your feed, here are the three tells. One, a download count with no'

[07:23] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'denominator. A million out of how many kept for how long? Two, a benchmark delta with no matched evaluation receipt and no sign of the numbers that didn\'t move. The eval setup has to sit right next to'

[07:36] [scene:talk]
